#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:1
msgid "Similar tools and differentiators"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:3
msgid ""
"The tools currently available with functions similar to those of the Open"
" Data Editor were created for a specific purpose and have a more "
"technical profile. This makes them difficult for people unfamiliar with "
"code, standards or programming languages to access."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:5
msgid ""
"The main differences in relation to ODE are listed in each subsection "
"below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:7
msgid "Data Check"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:9
msgid ""
"Available at: "
"[https://data.humdata.org/tools/datacheck/import](https://data.humdata.org/tools/datacheck/import)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:11
#: ../../source/introduction/similar-tools-and-differentiators.md:22
